---
import ToolLayout from '../../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
import ToolResultSupport from '../../components/tools/ToolResultSupport.astro';
import { getExamComparisonOptions, TIMELINE_BUFFER_MAX_DAYS } from '../../data/route-tools';
import { getToolCopy, type ToolLocale } from '../../data/tool-copy';

export interface Props { locale?: ToolLocale; }
const { locale = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const copy = getToolCopy('timeline', locale);
const isZh = locale === 'zh-CN';
const examComparisonOptions = getExamComparisonOptions({ locale });
---

<ToolLayout eyebrow={copy.eyebrow} title={copy.title} description={copy.description} current="timeline" locale={locale}>
    <div class="tool-workspace">
      <form id="timeline-form" class="tool-form" novalidate inert>
        <div class="tool-form-heading"><h2>{copy.formTitle}</h2><p>{copy.formIntro}</p></div>
        <div class="tool-field-grid">
          <label>{copy.fields.targetDate}<input name="targetDate" type="date" required /></label>
          <label>{copy.fields.exam}<select name="examId" required><option value="">{copy.text.selectExam}</option>{examComparisonOptions.map((exam) => <option value={exam.id}>{exam.label}</option>)}</select></label>
          <label>{copy.fields.wait}<input name="resultWaitDays" type="number" min="0" max={TIMELINE_BUFFER_MAX_DAYS} step="1" required inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="timeline-input-help" /></label>
          <label>{copy.fields.documents}<input name="documentPreparationDays" type="number" min="0" max={TIMELINE_BUFFER_MAX_DAYS} step="1" required inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="timeline-input-help" /></label>
          <label>{copy.fields.retake}<input name="retakeBufferDays" type="number" min="0" max={TIMELINE_BUFFER_MAX_DAYS} step="1" required inputmode="numeric" aria-describedby="timeline-input-help" /></label>
        </div>
        <p id="timeline-input-help">{copy.text.inputHelp}</p>
        <div class="tool-error-summary" id="timeline-error" data-error-summary role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></div>
        <button class="primary-action" type="submit">{copy.submitLabel}</button>
      </form>
      <section id="timeline-result" class="tool-result" hidden aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1">
        <div id="timeline-summary"></div>
        <ToolResultSupport resultId="timeline-summary" locale={locale} />
      </section>
    </div>

    {isZh && <section class="tool-guidance" data-tool-guidance aria-labelledby="timeline-guidance-title">
      <h2 id="timeline-guidance-title">{copy.guidanceTitle}</h2>
      <p>只有在你已有自己计划中的目标日期，并为每段外部等待取得当前书面信息时，才使用本工具。计算器只做减法，不会查找预约、名额、出分安排、重考规则、翻译要求或主管机关截止日期。</p>
      <h3>输入与公式</h3>
      <p>基础规划日期为 D − W − P；额外缓冲规划日期为 D − W − P − R。W、P、R 必须是你明确记录的假设或向相关机构确认的日历日数。</p>
      <h3>何时应停止</h3>
      <p>若任一字段未知、来自无关考点、依据口头承诺而非当前公布信息，或目标日期尚未确认，请保持未解决状态，不要为了得到结果而填入“通常”天数。</p>
      <h3>下一项官方核验</h3>
      <p>通过 <a href="https://www.goethe.de/en/spr/prf.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Goethe-Institut 考试目录</a>或 <a href="https://www.telc.net/en/language-examinations/find-a-telc-examination-centre/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">telc 考点查找器</a>找到所选考点，并保存每项缓冲期的来源、核验日期和范围；递交日期和材料规则应另向接收机关确认。</p>
    </section>}
    {!isZh && <section class="tool-guidance" data-tool-guidance aria-labelledby="timeline-guidance-title">
      <h2 id="timeline-guidance-title">When the Timeline Planner is safe to use</h2>
      <p>Use this planner only after you have a target date from your own application plan and written, current inputs for every external wait. The calculator performs subtraction; it does not discover an appointment, exam seat, result schedule, retake rule, translation requirement, or authority deadline. Do not use an online anecdote or another centre's timetable as a substitute for the organisation that controls your transaction.</p>

      <h3>Example input using confirmed buffers</h3>
      <dl data-tool-example-input>
        <dt>Target date (D)</dt><dd>The date in the user's own plan or current receiving-authority instruction.</dd>
        <dt>Exam type</dt><dd>The exact product being considered, such as Goethe-Zertifikat A1, without assuming it is accepted.</dd>
        <dt>Result and certificate wait (W)</dt><dd>The calendar-day number stated in the selected centre's current written information or entered explicitly as the user's assumption.</dd>
        <dt>Document preparation (P)</dt><dd>The calendar-day number confirmed for the user's actual document service and receiving authority.</dd>
        <dt>Additional retake buffer (R)</dt><dd>A user-chosen calendar-day contingency after checking the centre's retake and booking process.</dd>
      </dl>

      <h3>How to read the example output</h3>
      <div data-tool-example-output>
        <p>The base planning date is D − W − P. The additional-buffer planning date is D − W − P − R. Neither date is an appointment or a recommendation. It does not prove that a session, result or certificate will fit the plan. R is only the entered extra buffer: it does not guarantee or automatically include a real next session, re-registration, another result wait or certificate delivery.</p>
      </div>

      <h3>Stop and verify before calculating</h3>
      <p>Stop if any field is unknown, copied from an unrelated centre, based on a promised rather than published result, or older than the latest official update. Also stop if the target date is only a rumour or if the route may not require the planned proof. Leave the plan unresolved until each responsible organisation supplies the missing fact; do not enter a “typical” number just to obtain a result.</p>

      <h3>Official follow-up after the timeline</h3>
      <p>Reopen the selected provider or centre page—for example, use the <a href="https://www.goethe.de/en/spr/prf.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Goethe-Institut examination directory</a> or the <a href="https://www.telc.net/en/language-examinations/find-a-telc-examination-centre/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">telc examination-centre finder</a>—and save the exact source, check date, and scope of every entered buffer. Then confirm the submission date and document-handling rule with the receiving authority. The centre controls its schedule; the receiving authority controls what and when it will receive.</p>
    </section>}
</ToolLayout>

<script>
  import { getExamComparisonOptions, getTimelineResultState, parseTimelineBufferDays, timelinePlanningContract, TIMELINE_BUFFER_MAX_DAYS } from '../../data/route-tools';
  import { getToolCopy } from '../../data/tool-copy';
  import { setupSharedPlan } from '../../scripts/plan-state';
  import { setupToolForm } from '../../scripts/tool-form';

  const form = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#timeline-form');
  const resultPanel = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#timeline-result');
  const summary = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#timeline-summary');
  const locale = document.documentElement.lang === 'zh-CN' ? 'zh-CN' : 'en';
  const isZh = locale === 'zh-CN';
  const copy = getToolCopy('timeline', locale);
  const examComparisonOptions = getExamComparisonOptions({ locale });

  const invalidateTimeline = () => {
    if (summary) summary.replaceChildren();
    if (resultPanel) resultPanel.hidden = true;
  };

  const plan = setupSharedPlan({ toolId: 'timeline', form });
  const timelineDayFields = new Set(['resultWaitDays', 'documentPreparationDays', 'retakeBufferDays']);
  const controller = form ? setupToolForm(form, {
    customError: (field) => timelineDayFields.has(field.name) && field.value && parseTimelineBufferDays(field.value) === null
      ? (isZh ? `请仅用数字输入 0 到 ${TIMELINE_BUFFER_MAX_DAYS} 之间的整数。` : `Enter a whole number from 0 to ${TIMELINE_BUFFER_MAX_DAYS} using digits only.`)
      : undefined,
    locale,
    onRestart: () => { invalidateTimeline(); plan.restartCurrentTool(); },
  }) : undefined;
  form?.addEventListener('input', invalidateTimeline);
  form?.addEventListener('change', invalidateTimeline);
  form?.addEventListener('submit', (event) => {
    event.preventDefault();
    if (!controller?.validate()) return;
    const input = Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());
    const timelineState = getTimelineResultState(input, { locale });
    if (timelineState.status === 'invalid') {
      if (summary) summary.replaceChildren();
      if (resultPanel) resultPanel.hidden = true;
      controller.reportError(timelineState.field === 'today' ? 'targetDate' : timelineState.field, timelineState.message);
      return;
    }
    const timelineResult = timelineState.calculation;
    if (!summary || !resultPanel) return;
    plan.persist({
      examId: input.examId,
      targetDate: input.targetDate,
      resultWaitDays: input.resultWaitDays,
      documentPreparationDays: input.documentPreparationDays,
      retakeBufferDays: input.retakeBufferDays,
    });
    summary.replaceChildren();
    const heading = document.createElement('h2');
    heading.textContent = copy.resultTitle;
    const intro = document.createElement('p');
    const selectedExam = examComparisonOptions.find((exam) => exam.id === input.examId);
    intro.textContent = isZh
      ? `对于${selectedExam?.label || '所选考试'}，基础日期倒推 ${timelineResult.basePlanningDays} 个日历日；额外缓冲日期倒推 ${timelineResult.additionalBufferPlanningDays} 个日历日。`
      : `For ${selectedExam?.label || 'the selected exam'}, the base date subtracts ${timelineResult.basePlanningDays} calendar days; the additional-buffer date subtracts ${timelineResult.additionalBufferPlanningDays} calendar days.`;
    const formula = document.createElement('p');
    formula.textContent = isZh ? `基础公式：${timelinePlanningContract.formulas.basePlanningDate}。额外缓冲公式：${timelinePlanningContract.formulas.additionalBufferPlanningDate}。` : `Base: ${timelinePlanningContract.formulas.basePlanningDate}. Additional buffer: ${timelinePlanningContract.formulas.additionalBufferPlanningDate}.`;
    const list = document.createElement('dl');
    list.className = 'tool-timeline-list';
    [
      [copy.fields.targetDate, timelineResult.targetDate],
      [isZh ? '成绩与证书等待（W）' : 'Result and certificate wait (W)', isZh ? `${String(input.resultWaitDays)} 个日历日` : `${String(input.resultWaitDays)} calendar days`],
      [isZh ? '材料准备（P）' : 'Document preparation (P)', isZh ? `${String(input.documentPreparationDays)} 个日历日` : `${String(input.documentPreparationDays)} calendar days`],
      [isZh ? '额外重考缓冲（R）' : 'Additional retake buffer (R)', isZh ? `${String(input.retakeBufferDays)} 个日历日` : `${String(input.retakeBufferDays)} calendar days`],
      [isZh ? '基础规划日期' : 'Base planning date', `${timelineResult.basePlanningDate} (${isZh ? ({ past: '已过去', today: '今天', future: '未来' }[timelineState.basePlanningDateState]) : timelineState.basePlanningDateState})`],
      [isZh ? '额外缓冲规划日期' : 'Additional-buffer planning date', `${timelineResult.additionalBufferPlanningDate} (${isZh ? ({ past: '已过去', today: '今天', future: '未来' }[timelineState.additionalBufferPlanningDateState]) : timelineState.additionalBufferPlanningDateState})`],
    ].forEach(([label, date]) => {
      const term = document.createElement('dt'); term.textContent = label;
      const detail = document.createElement('dd'); detail.textContent = date;
      list.append(term, detail);
    });
    const boundary = document.createElement('p');
    boundary.textContent = isZh ? 'W、P 和 R 是用户输入的规划假设或当地确认值，并非官方默认值；任何计算日期都不保证报名、成绩、证书、接受决定或申请结果。' : timelinePlanningContract.boundary;
    const retakeBoundary = document.createElement('p');
    retakeBoundary.textContent = isZh ? 'R 只是额外日历日缓冲，不保证或自动包含真实的下一场考试、重新报名、另一笔费用、再次等待成绩或证书寄送。' : timelinePlanningContract.retakeBoundary;
    summary.append(heading, intro, formula, list);
    if (timelineState.requiresAttention) {
      const attention = document.createElement('section');
      attention.className = 'tool-notice tool-notice--attention';
      const attentionHeading = document.createElement('h3');
      attentionHeading.textContent = isZh ? '需要调整当前假设' : 'The current assumptions need to change';
      const attentionText = document.createElement('p');
      attentionText.textContent = isZh ? `按当前输入，至少一个规划日期早于 ${timelineState.today}，因此不能再按此方式安排。请调整假设，或核验真实可用场次与当前出分流程。` : `With the current inputs, this plan can no longer be arranged this way because at least one calculated planning date is before ${timelineState.today}. Change the assumptions or check an actual available session and current result process.`;
      attention.append(attentionHeading, attentionText);
      summary.append(attention);
    }
    summary.append(boundary, retakeBoundary);
    resultPanel.hidden = false;
    controller.markResult();
    resultPanel.focus();
  });
  controller?.activate();
</script>
